https://openclipart.org/detail/279931/great-wall-of-china

src/ui/styles/palettes/qiangguo/taishan-*.webp are cut into strokes, tinted and faded from
"Nantianmen (" porte Céleste du Sud ") - A1365.jpg" by Stéphane Passet (1913),
Musée départemental Albert-Kahn, CC0 1.0, via Wikimedia Commons:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nantianmen_(%22_porte_C%C3%A9leste_du_Sud_%22)_-_A1365.jpg

src/ui/styles/palettes/qiangguo/gorges-*.webp are cut into strokes, tinted and faded from
"Qutang Gorge on Changjiang.jpg" by Tan Wei Liang Byorn, CC BY 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Qutang_Gorge_on_Changjiang.jpg
The images are licensed under CC BY 3.0; see LICENSES/CC-BY-3.0.txt.

src/ui/styles/palettes/qiangguo/lake-*.webp are cut, combined and tinted from
two photographs by Bernard Gagnon on Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 3.0:
