https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ci_En_Pagoda_01.jpg
The combined images are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0; see LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

src/ui/styles/palettes/qiangguo/square-*.webp are cut, combined and tinted from
three photographs on Wikimedia Commons:
"20200110 Tiananmen-6.jpg" and "20200110 Tiananmen statue-1.jpg" by Balon Greyjoy,
CC0 1.0:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20200110_Tiananmen-6.jpg
