Twemoji Country Flags
The flags-only font in src/ui/assets/TwemojiCountryFlags.woff2 is vendored
unchanged from country-flag-emoji-polyfill 0.1.10 by TalkJS. It is a subset
of Twemoji Mozilla by the Mozilla Foundation, using Twemoji artwork by
Twitter and other contributors. The subset retains regional indicators
and the England, Scotland and Wales tag sequences.
Source: https://github.com/talkjs/country-flag-emoji-polyfill
Font build: https://github.com/mozilla/twemoji-colr
Artwork: https://github.com/twitter/twemoji
The artwork is licensed under CC BY 4.0; see LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.
